course: dictionary
lesson: 5394
title: Kodiak: an island and a bear
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A capital letter in the middle of a sentence often means a name. Kodiak starts with a capital K, so it names one special thing, not any island or any bear. Read the words around it to find out which thing it is.
explain: Two-word phrases give clues. In «a Kodiak bear», the word Kodiak tells you which kind of bear it is. The dictionary says a Kodiak bear is a very large kind of brown bear that lives on Kodiak and nearby islands, so the island and the bear share the name.
explain: Context also tells you about size and strength. «A big Kodiak can weigh over 600 kilograms» means these bears are very heavy. «A hump of muscle on the shoulders helps them dig» tells you they are strong. Check your meaning by putting it into the sentence: a very large bear fits well.
fact: Kodiak is a large island off the south coast of Alaska, USA.
fact: A Kodiak bear is a very large kind of brown bear that lives on Kodiak and nearby islands.
fact: «A big Kodiak can weigh over 600 kilograms.»
fact: Brown bears live in North America, Europe and Asia, and grizzlies and Kodiak bears are both brown bears.
fact: A capital letter, like the K in Kodiak, often shows a name for a particular place or thing.
exercise: «A big Kodiak can weigh over 600 kilograms.» What does Kodiak mean here? | A small grey bird | *A very large kind of brown bear | A large island in Alaska | A type of fish
exercise: Where does the Kodiak bear live? | *On Kodiak and nearby islands | Only in Europe | In the desert
exercise: «Brown bears live in North America, Europe and Asia.» Find and copy one word that names a continent. | live | bears | *Asia | brown
test: «Grizzlies and Kodiak bears are brown bears, and a hump of muscle on the shoulders helps them dig.» What does the hump help them do? | Swim fast | *Dig | Sing | Fly
test: Which sentence is true? | A Kodiak is a kind of castle | A Kodiak bear is a kind of fish | *A Kodiak bear is a very large kind of brown bear | Kodiak bears live only in Asia
exam: Kodiak is a large island off the south coast of which place? | Greenland | Canada | *Alaska | Russia
